# The build context for src/filesystem/Dockerfile (#5345). BuildKit reads a
# `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile in place of a root
# .dockerignore, so this allow-list applies to this image only. The context is
# the repository root, so start from nothing and admit only what the build
# copies: the root manifests and lockfile, and the server's source without
# its build output or test artifacts.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.json
!src/filesystem
src/filesystem/node_modules
src/filesystem/dist
src/filesystem/coverage
